WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
search++: search everything in VS Code from one popup

00:00:03.907 --> 00:00:08.137
Double-tap Shift to search everything (⇧ ⇧)

00:00:08.137 --> 00:00:09.772
Tab switches mode and keeps your query (Tab)

00:00:09.772 --> 00:00:13.836
Right Arrow previews while search stays open (→)

00:00:13.836 --> 00:00:20.776
Search file contents, powered by ripgrep (Tab)

00:00:20.776 --> 00:00:23.868
Find functions and classes from your language servers (Tab)

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:26.400
List every usage without leaving the popup (⌘ Return; Ctrl+Enter on Windows and Linux)

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.344
Type to filter usages, then preview one

00:00:30.344 --> 00:00:33.731
Back restores your previous search

00:00:33.731 --> 00:00:37.712
Find commands in the same popup (Tab)

00:00:37.712 --> 00:00:43.570
Jump straight to a file and line (⇧ ⇧)

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:49.082
Choose your tabs, order and shortcuts in Settings

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:53.082
Install free from the VS Code Marketplace: expiracy.search-plus-plus
